# Doc file useful for Claude
doc/*
# ...except the Figma design tokens: src/theme/tokens.js imports them, so the
# build breaks on a fresh clone without this. Git will not descend into an
# ignored directory, hence the step-by-step un-ignore.
!doc/assets/
doc/assets/*
!doc/assets/variables.tokens.json

Relazione/main.pdf
